bunvex is an independent implementation written from scratch. Its design was informed by studying the
public architecture of Convex (https://github.com/get-convex/convex-backend); no Convex source code is
included.

bunvex is not affiliated with or endorsed by Convex, Inc. "Convex" is a trademark of Convex, Inc., used
only to describe compatibility.

Third-party material bundled with the dashboard (@bunvex/ui, @bunvex/dashboard):

- mapcn (https://github.com/AnmolSaini16/mapcn), MIT License — the map component
  (packages/ui/src/components/map.tsx), modified to bundle MapLibre's worker and use no hosted basemap.
- Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), public domain — the countries of the analytics map,
  through world-atlas (https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas), ISC License.

